#lang punct notepad

---
title: About The Notepad
---

*The Notepad* is the successor to my old tech-notes blog “Notepad.Exe”. I am
[Joel Dueck]. It’s a place to put technical jibberish that is not of General
Interest.

As of 2026 I build and manage the site with
[Camp](https://joeldueck.com/what-about/camp/). Each post is also published as
plain Markdown: change `.html` to `.md` at the end of its address. You can see
[the source code on Github](https://github.com/otherjoel/thenotepad).

## History

From 2005 to 2016 the site was hosted on
[blogspot.com](http://notely.blogspot.com/2008/07/resurrected.html)[^1].

From 2016 to 2026 the site was built with
[Pollen](https://docs.racket-lang.org/pollen/).

